# Ornery Tumblewagg's two triggers target any creature (CR 115.1), not just itself. Turn 1: its combat counter goes on itself (the only creature). Turn 3: saddled by
# Grizzly Bears, its combat counter goes on Bot2's Memnite (2/2), and the saddled attack doubles the Memnite's counter to two (3/3); the Tumblewagg keeps its one.
# Turn 5: saddled again, the combat counter goes on Bot1's Grizzly Bears (3/3); the attack trigger targets the Bears and a Lightning Bolt kills them in response,
# so the doubling does nothing (CR 608.2b): the Tumblewagg still has one counter and the Memnite two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornery Tumblewagg
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornery Tumblewagg.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Activate(Ability: Saddle)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornery Tumblewagg > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Activate(Ability: Saddle)
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
[T5 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornery Tumblewagg > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornery Tumblewagg.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
